              "blocks": {
                "text_GhPD69": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>The Meke Milk device comes with a USB type C cable, which you can use to charge it. However, you must use a 5V 2A adapter for charging and avoid using an iPhone charger as it has the potential to damage the power board.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
