              "blocks": {
                "text_hqA84X": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Please verify that you are using the correct 5V/2A charger and the provided USB cord. Using the incorrect charger may not allow the device to charge properly, and in the worst case, it could potentially damage the motherboard. Ensure that you are using the recommended charger and cable to avoid any potential issues</p>",
