            "accordion_row_m6D6qe": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How is the Meke Milk Warmer safer than other electronic warmers?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_cFLM3h": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We have taken every measure to ensure that our product is safe for contact with milk. We understand the importance of providing a safe and reliable product for families and have therefore chosen materials that undergo rigorous testing to ensure their safety.Our milk warmers have undergone rigorous testing and meets all the regulatory requirements for AU/NZ, EU10/2011, and CE standards, ensuring maximum quality and safety for all our customers.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
