            },
            "accordion_row_EH3bai": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What material is the Meke Milk Warmer made from?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_jdVXgx": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Tritan material used in our equipment is shatter-resistant, which means that it can withstand sudden temperature changes without breaking or cracking. As an added measure, Tritan is also BPA-free, ensuring that it is a safe and non-toxic material for warming milk. Our heating plate features a platinum silicone barrier that surrounds the SUS 316 food-grade stainless steel. Platinum silicone is a type of silicone that is considered to be of higher quality than other types of silicone, such as food-safe silicone. Platinum silicone is more durable, heat-resistant, and chemically resistant.​This combination of materials has been carefully selected for their durability and resistance to corrosion, ensuring that our product is not only safe, but also dependable for heating milk.​</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
